    "source": "Avatar",
    "description": "<p>Those affected by this Technique suffer blurred vision or near-complete blindness with a raise.</p><p>Success means the victim suffers a −2 penalty to all actions involving sight, or −4 with a raise.</p><p>The victim automatically tries to shake off the effect with a Vigor roll as a free action at the end of his following turns. Success removes 2 points of penalties, and a raise removes the effect entirely.</p>",
